ain Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:02:19.97,0:02:20.01,Captions,,520,0,120,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:02:20.01,0:02:20.06,Captions,,520,0,120,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:02:20.06,0:02:20.10,Captions,,520,0,120,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:02:20.10,0:02:20.14,Captions,,520,0,120,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:02:20.14,0:02:20.18,Captions,,520,0,120,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:02:20.18,0:02:20.22,Captions,,520,0,120,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:02:20.22,0:02:20.26,Captions,,520,0,120,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:02:20.26,0:02:20.31,Captions,,520,0,120,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:02:20.31,0:02:20.35,Captions,,520,0,120,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:02:20.35,0:02:20.39,Captions,,520,0,120,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:02:19.39,0:02:20.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Kill them!Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.40,0:02:23.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Bring down every single one of them here!Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.48,0:02:27.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Fire! Send the Navy packing!Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.01,0:02:33.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, uh-huh...Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.89,0:02:41.69,Main,,0,0,0,,You... bastards!Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.56,0:02:47.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh... Uh-huh, uh-huh...Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.19,0:02:53.11,Main,,0,0,0,,I understand!Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.11,0:02:57.64,Main,,0,0,0,,So, when the brothers Sodom and Gomorrah were going to die...Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.64,0:03:03.09,Main,,0,0,0,,in a Sea King's stomach, the Franky Family saved them and said this to them...Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.09,0:03:06.64,Main,,0,0,0,,"We're full, so we're not gonna eat you guys!"Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.64,0:03:11.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Since then, they have been loyal to Franky, who saved their lives.Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.67,0:03:17.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, they just happened to be in the stomach of a Sea King...Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.90,0:03:20.94,Main,,0,0,0,,that the Franky Family was eating, right?Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.01,0:03:23.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Probably.Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.62,0:03:25.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever...Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.03,0:03:28.46,Main,,0,0,0,,But can you watch where you're going? You're making me nervous.Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.35,0:03:34.46,Main,,0,0,0,,He says: "I'll be faithful to Big Bro Franky for the rest of my life!"Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.46,0:03:38.55,Main,,0,0,0,,He must be really happy that someone understands his language.Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.16,0:03:50.38,Main,,0,0,0,,He's asking: "By the way, was it okay that the guy with the maskDialogue: 0,0:03:50.38,0:03:52.06,Main,,0,0,0,,didn't get on with you guys?"Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.96,0:03:53.52,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.52,0:03:54.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.67,0:03:55.20,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.20,0:03:57.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm...?Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.14,0:04:02.28,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! I-I don't see Sogeking onboard!Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.56,0:04:05.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Why?! Why?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.88,0:04:08.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Did he fall off?Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.13,0:04:11.26,Main,,0,0,0,,No... Come to think of it, he wasn't riding with us from the start!Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.26,0:04:13.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me he ran...!Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.96,0:04:14.00,Captions,,0,660,550,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:04:14.00,0:04:14.04,Captions,,0,660,550,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:04:14.04,0:04:14.09,Captions,,0,660,550,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:04:14.09,0:04:14.13,Captions,,0,660,550,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:04:14.13,0:04:14.17,Captions,,0,660,550,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:04:14.17,0:04:14.21,Captions,,0,660,550,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:04:14.21,0:04:14.25,Captions,,0,660,550,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:04:14.25,0:04:14.30,Captions,,0,660,550,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:04:14.30,0:04:14.34,Captions,,0,660,550,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:04:14.34,0:04:14.38,Captions,,0,660,550,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:04:14.38,0:04:14.42,Captions,,0,660,550,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:04:14.42,0:04:14.46,Captions,,0,660,550,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:04:14.46,0:04:14.50,Captions,,0,660,550,,CourthouseDial