tions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:15.09,0:04:15.13,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:15.13,0:04:15.17,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:15.17,0:04:15.21,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:15.21,0:04:15.25,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:15.25,0:04:15.30,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:15.30,0:04:15.34,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:15.34,0:04:15.38,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:15.38,0:04:15.42,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:15.42,0:04:15.46,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:15.46,0:04:15.50,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:15.50,0:04:15.55,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:15.55,0:04:15.59,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:15.59,0:04:15.63,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:15.63,0:04:15.67,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:15.67,0:04:15.71,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:15.71,0:04:15.75,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:15.75,0:04:15.80,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:15.80,0:04:15.84,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:15.84,0:04:15.88,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:15.88,0:04:15.92,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:15.92,0:04:15.96,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:15.96,0:04:16.01,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:16.01,0:04:16.05,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:16.05,0:04:16.09,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:16.09,0:04:16.13,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:16.13,0:04:16.17,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:16.17,0:04:16.21,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:16.21,0:04:16.26,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:16.26,0:04:16.30,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:16.30,0:04:16.34,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:16.34,0:04:16.38,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:16.38,0:04:16.42,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:16.42,0:04:16.46,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:16.46,0:04:16.51,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:16.51,0:04:16.55,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:16.55,0:04:16.59,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:16.59,0:04:16.63,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:16.63,0:04:16.67,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:16.67,0:04:16.71,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:16.71,0:04:16.76,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:16.76,0:04:16.80,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:16.80,0:04:16.84,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:16.84,0:04:16.88,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:16.92,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:16.92,0:04:16.96,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:16.96,0:04:17.05,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:17.05,0:04:17.30,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:17.30,0:04:17.38,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:17.38,0:04:17.51,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:17.51,0:04:18.42,Captions,,650,0,140,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:04:18.42,0:04:22.95,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastard! Stop blocking the path!Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.60,0:04:26.62,Main,,0,0,0,,If you want to go through us, beat me first!Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.62,0:04:30.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Get out of our way!Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.46,0:04:35.77,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not gonna be that easy!Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.94,0:04:39.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Battleship Cannon!Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.07,0:04:46.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit! There's only three of them! Do something!Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.50,0:04:57.66,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You're... strong when you fight, right?Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.30,0:05:00.74,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Do you think you can beat them?Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.74,0:05:02.08,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Definitely!Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.88,0:05:09.95,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,In a moment of uncertainty, anyone would be weak.Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.20,0:05:16.92,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Now that we know she needs to be saved, our strength will be infinite!Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.50,0:05:22.84,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We'll bring down the whole place!Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.84,0:05:25.30,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,There's a technique that I wanna try, too!Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.48,0:05:29.94,Main,,0,0,0,,That guy will... definitely...!Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.06,0:05:34.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Bring down that rope guy!Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.06,0:05:36.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Not gonna happen!Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.63,0:05:40.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Shrouds and Ratline Knot!Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.56,0:05:42.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, shoot!Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.66,0:05:47.23,Main,,0,0,0,,You've reached a dead end. Give up.Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.72,0:05:59.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Why don't you tell me your point?Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.81,0:06:06.73,Main,,0,0,0,,The World Government is a huge, powerful organizationDialogue: 0,0:06:06.73,0:06:11.04,Main,,0,0,0,,that is comprised of over 170 countries around the world.Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.04,0:06:13.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Invading this island, which belongs to the Government...Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.55,0:06:17.70,Main,,0,0,0,,is an act of revolt against all those countries!Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.70,0:06:24.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Upon their dignity, the Government will expose all of you to public ridicule...Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.01,0:06:26.69,Main,,0,0,0,,and will bestow a merciless death upon you.Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.69,0:06:29.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Your group is composed of a meager few dozen.Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.98,0:06:32.63,Main,,0,0,0,,That is nowhere near enough.Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.63,0:06:36.68,Main,,0,0,0,,All I did was tell you to get out of my way.Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.68,0:06:42.21,Main,,0,0,0,,My point is that you, who entered the gates of Enies Lobby, has no future...Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.21,0:06:45.39,Main,,0,0,0,,even if I do move out of your way. That's all.Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.39,0:06:46.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Fighting is pointless.Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.98,0:06:52.28,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure you got a good taste of our Six Powers at Galley-La's mansion...Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.01,0:06:56.46,Main,,0,0,0,,as well as the difference in our levels of fighting ability.Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.12,0:07:00.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's true...Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.97,0:07:06.10,Main,,0,0,0,,but for some reason, I don't feel like I'm gonna lose at all now!Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.54,0:07:11.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.69,0:07:12.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Iron Body.Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.28,0:07:14.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Rifle!Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.62,0:07:31.05,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What?! I don't remember him being this powerful...Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.05,0:07:33.70,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,when I fought him at the mansion!Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.70,0:07:36.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Gatling!Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.60,0:07:37.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Shave!Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.14,0:08:12.62,Main,,0,0,0,,The world this, the Government that...Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.62,0:08:14.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't care about that stuff.Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.86,0:08:25.22,Main,,0,0,0,,We just came here.... to take Robin back!Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.81,0:08:37.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Kyah! Wh-Wh-What're we gonna do?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.22,0:08:44.13,Main,,0,0,0,,In any case, we don't have the option of going back to get him at this point.Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.78,0:08:48.09,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he'll work things out on his own.Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.09,0:08:50.76,Main,,0,0,0,,But there are guards everywhere on this island.Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.76,0:08:53.93,Main,,0,0,0,,He isn't Luffy. If he's by himself, his life will be...Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.93,0:09:00.17,Main,,0,0,0,,After surmounting each island, we got stronger without realizing it.Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.17,0:09:03.86,Main,,0,0,0,,That guy always survived life-or-death situations on every island.Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.86,0:09:08.42,Main,,0,0,0,,No one in our group would die so easily.Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.95,0:09:16.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Look! We're almost to the courthouse!Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.77,0:09:20.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Bring them down at all cost!Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.36,0:09:29.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Crap! King Bull!Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.23,0:09:32.14,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! We brought down one of them!Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.99,0:09:34.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Sodom!Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.98,0:09:39.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Sodom!Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.30,0:09:41.21,Main,,0,0,0,,This is bad! I have to treat him right away!Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.21,0:09:44.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Sodom! Stand firm! Don't fall yet!Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.13,0:09:51.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Guys! Move over right away! Hurry it up!Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.01,0:09:53.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Sodom can't go on much longer!Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.52,0:09:56.86,Main,,0,0,0,,His pectoral muscle was hit by a trench mortar!Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.86,0:09:58.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Move over now before he falls!Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.44,0:10:02.11,Main,,0,0,0,,No one's gonna be saved unless you guys move forward!Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.37,0:10:16.15,Main,,0,0,0,,He said: "Go!"Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.22,0:10:31.39,Main,,0,0,0,,It's coming down!Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.31,0:10:54.29,Main,,0,0,0,,No one's riding it!Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.29,0:10:55.83,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.41,0:10:59.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey...Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.30,0:11:01.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Gomorrah!Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.12,0:11:05.84,Captions,,20,0,35,,Main Island Front GateDialogue: 0,0:11:10.67,0:11:13.40,Main,,0,0,0,,I wasn't able to get on the King Bull.Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.40,0:11:16.37,Main,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do? I'm way behind now.Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.44,0:11:19.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Battleship Cannon!Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.42,0:11:32.74,Main,,0,0,0,,In any case, those shipwrights are amazing!Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.72,0:11:39.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyways, I left the group. Should I just run?Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.38,0:11:42.02,Main,,0,0,0,,N-N-No! Running is the last thing I'll do!Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.02,0:11:46.73,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Usopp! I'm a man! I went so far as to hide my identity to follow them!Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.73,0:11:50.65,Main,,0,0,0,,We're facing a crisis where Robin is sacrificing herself to protect all of us!Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.65,0:11:52.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I have to do it at all costs!Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.00,0:11:58.32,Main,,0,0,0,,All right... There's only one way to get to everyone.Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.32,0:12:02.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll carry out Operation: Disguise Myself as One of the Government Workers...Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.33,0:12:04.75,Main,,0,0,0,,and Pass by Them Unnoticed!Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.62,0:12:10.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that'd be good.Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.15,0:12:11.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.19,0:12:16.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa! What?! What?! Are they trying to drown me?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.55,0:12:19.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Enemy attack! Enemy attack!Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.18,0:12:22.97,Main,,0,0,0,,How regrettable!Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.97,0:12:27.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Ahhh! The Giant woke up!Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.15,0:12:32.07,Main,,0,0,0,,We screwed up in our 50th year! I'm sorry, bosses!Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.07,0:12:33.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Bosses?Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.57,0:12:37.96,Main,,0,0,0,,We are a disgrace to Elbaf!Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.96,0:12:40.44,Main,,0,0,0,,E-Elbaf?Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.27,0:12:44.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Elbaf... Bosses...Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.82,0:12:50.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...! I-Is it possible that you're from Elbaf, the warriors' island?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.21,0:12:52.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Who are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.40,0:12:56.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I-I am Sogeking from the island of snipers.Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.38,0:12:59.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Can you explain what you're talking about?Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.09,0:13:02.05,Main,,0,0,0,,You're a total stranger from God knows where!Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.05,0:13:04.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Why should I tell you?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.79,0:13:10.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Calm down! Warriors from Elbaf are the proudest men in the world!Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.25,0:13:13.45,Main,,0,0,0,,And yet, you're crying a river here. It must be a big deal.Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.45,0:13:15.82,Main,,0,0,0,,So I want to know why.Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.14,0:13:19.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Please...Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.10,0:13:23.06,Main,,0,0,0,,It's pointless to tell you about it, but...Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.85,0:13:30.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Oimo and Kashi were pirates up until 100 years ago...Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.28,0:13:33.10,Main,,0,0,0,,and we ran amok all over the world.Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.26,0:13:35.25,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.25,0:13:38.87,Main,,0,0,0,,But one day on a certain island...Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.87,0:13:40.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Cheers!Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.66,0:13:45.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Each one of 'em bagged an insanely huge Sea King, after all!Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.26,0:13:47.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Even though we're Elbaf Giants,Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.74,0:13:51.83,Main,,0,0,0,,nobody can take down those jumbo-sized beasts except for our bosses!Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.83,0:13:54.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Right, men?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.84,0:14:00.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Those ones were definitely the biggest ones...Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.49,0:14:04.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah! The biggest ones we've ever caught!Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.64,0:14:09.87,Main,,0,0,0,,So which one was bigger?Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.23,0:14:18.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Our two bosses then started to duel.Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.79,0:14:24.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Our bosses are in a duel where they're putting their pride on the line. It can't be helped.Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.68,0:14:27.26,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the signal for the duel.Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.84,0:14:31.61,Main,,0,0,0,,The group was split up...Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.61,0:14:35.68,Main,,0,0,0,,and everyone ended up going back to their hometown.Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.68,0:14:37.81,Main,,0,0,0,,A central mountain...Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.81,0:14:40.50,Main,,0,0,0,,It was a life-or-death battle between warriors.Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.50,0:14:43.96,Main,,0,0,0,,At the very least, the winner was supposed to come back to the island.Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.96,0:14:48.13,Main,,0,0,0,,but even after several decades, neither of them came back.Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.13,0:14:53.04,Main,,0,0,0,,After 50 years passed, me and Kashi thought something was wrong,Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.04,0:14:55.80,Main,,0,0,0,,so we set out to sea to go get those two.Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.80,0:15:00.05,Main,,0,0,0,,But on our way, we got caught by the Navy, and they made us tell them everything.Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.05,0:15:04.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, in return, we were told a shocking story.Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.27,0:15:06.69,Main,,0,0,0,,They said that our bosses, who were very strong,Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.69,0:15:10.98,Main,,0,0,0,,were confined in the Government's large prison!Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.98,0:15:11.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.92,0:15:15.31,Main,,0,0,0,,That was about 50 years ago.Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.31,0:15:16.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.43,0:15:19.02,Main,,0,0,0,,The Government gave us these conditions:Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.02,0:15:23.08,Main,,0,0,0,,If me and Kashi worked for the Government for 100 years...Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.08,0:15:27.73,Main,,0,0,0,,in other words, if we could protect this gate on Enies Lobby for 100 years...Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.73,0:15:33.45,Main,,0,0,0,,they'd release our bosses and let us all go home to Elbaf.Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.45,0:15:37.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Since a Giant's life span is 300 years, we thought 100 years was nothing.Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.96,0:15:41.33,Main,,0,0,0,,So we accepted the conditions and have kept fighting for the past 50 years.Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.33,0:15:45.46,Main,,0,0,0,,But the gate was broken open today by pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.46,0:15:48.03,Main,,0,0,0,,To think something like this happened...!Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.03,0:15:54.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Our bosses will now be imprisoned for the rest of their lives!Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.45,0:15:56.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey! H-H-Hold on a sec!Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.43,0:15:58.03,Main,,0,0,0,,There's something funny about that story.Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.03,0:16:02.65,Main,,0,0,0,,What's funny about it?! If you're gonna laugh at our pride, then...Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.65,0:16:05.98,Main,,0,0,0,,No, no, I didn't mean it that way! I meant that it's weird!Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.98,0:16:07.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Weird, you say?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.88,0:16:13.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Because during our journey before we came here, we met them!Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.54,0:16:20.27,Main,,0,0,0,,The two you've been talking about, the Elbaf warriors, Dorry and Brogy...Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.27,0:16:25.42,Main,,0,0,0,,have been fighting an evenly matched duel on that island for the past 100 years!Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.10,0:16:32.35,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! How come you know their names?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.35,0:16:34.42,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! That's impossible!Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.42,0:16:38.68,Main,,0,0,0,,If you wanna hear more proof, I'll tell you as much as you want!Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.31,0:16:45.92,Main,,0,0,0,,And...Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.58,0:17:01.14,Main,,0,0,0,,You still don't believe me?! What do I have to tell you to get you to believe me?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.02,0:17:07.62,Main,,0,0,0,,About their weapons?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.54,0:17:12.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Their techniques?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.98,0:17:16.45,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,73,466 duels...Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.45,0:17:18.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I know everything!Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.13,0:17:21.84,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,73,466 draws...Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.84,0:17:27.29,Main,,0,0,0,,We really met them!Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.17,0:17:39.72,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You fought desperately to protect our pride.Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.72,0:17:43.15,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,As such, no matter what manner of enemy there may be...Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.15,0:17:46.20,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We will not let them destroy your pride, friends!Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.20,0:17:49.62,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Have faith in us, and continue straight ahead!Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.64,0:17:56.40,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Let's meet again someday.Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.56,0:18:00.50,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Without fail.Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.77,0:18:09.16,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Warrior's Might!Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.68,0:18:18.45,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We're flying out of it!Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.45,0:18:23.37,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a big fat lie that they got caught 50 years ago!Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.22,0:18:34.27,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:34.27,0:18:34.32,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:34.32,0:18:34.36,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:34.36,0:18:34.41,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:34.41,0:18:34.46,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:34.46,0:18:34.50,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:34.50,0:18:34.55,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:34.55,0:18:34.60,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:34.60,0:18:34.64,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:34.64,0:18:34.68,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:34.68,0:18:34.73,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:34.73,0:18:34.78,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:34.78,0:18:34.82,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:34.82,0:18:34.87,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:34.87,0:18:34.91,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:34.91,0:18:34.95,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:34.95,0:18:35.00,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:35.00,0:18:35.05,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:35.10,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:35.10,0:18:35.14,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:35.14,0:18:35.18,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:35.18,0:18:35.23,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:35.23,0:18:35.28,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:35.28,0:18:35.33,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:35.33,0:18:35.37,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:35.37,0:18:35.41,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:35.41,0:18:35.46,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:35.46,0:18:35.50,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:35.50,0:18:35.55,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:35.55,0:18:35.59,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:35.59,0:18:35.63,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:35.63,0:18:35.68,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:35.68,0:18:35.73,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:35.73,0:18:35.78,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:35.78,0:18:35.83,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:35.83,0:18:35.88,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:35.88,0:18:35.92,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:35.92,0:18:35.97,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:35.97,0:18:36.01,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:36.01,0:18:36.06,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:36.06,0:18:36.11,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:36.11,0:18:36.16,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:36.16,0:18:36.21,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:36.21,0:18:36.26,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:36.26,0:18:36.30,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:36.30,0:18:36.35,Captions,,0,570,580,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:18:36.35,0:18:36.40,Captions,,0,570,580,