 0,0:18:36.87,0:18:36.92,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:36.92,0:18:36.97,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:36.97,0:18:37.01,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:37.01,0:18:37.05,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:37.05,0:18:37.09,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:37.09,0:18:37.14,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:37.14,0:18:37.19,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:37.19,0:18:37.23,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:37.23,0:18:37.28,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:37.28,0:18:37.33,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:37.33,0:18:37.37,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:37.37,0:18:37.42,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:37.42,0:18:37.47,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:37.47,0:18:37.51,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:37.51,0:18:37.55,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:37.55,0:18:37.59,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:37.59,0:18:37.63,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:37.63,0:18:37.67,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:37.67,0:18:37.72,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:37.72,0:18:37.77,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:37.77,0:18:37.82,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:37.82,0:18:37.86,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:37.86,0:18:37.90,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:37.90,0:18:37.94,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:37.94,0:18:38.07,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:38.07,0:18:38.12,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:38.12,0:18:38.41,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:38.41,0:18:38.45,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:38.45,0:18:38.58,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:38.58,0:18:38.63,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:38.63,0:18:38.67,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:38.67,0:18:38.72,Captions,,720,0,200,,Rocket ManDialogue: 0,0:18:50.53,0:18:52.89,Main,,0,0,0,,It's coming! Take aim!Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.01,0:18:56.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Let it get closer!Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.74,0:18:59.62,Main,,0,0,0,,That's a trench mortar! Dodge it, Gomorrah!Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.74,0:19:06.82,Main,,0,0,0,,This center path isn't good. They're fully prepared and waiting in ambush!Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.82,0:19:08.34,Main,,0,0,0,,We're gonna go a different way!Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.12,0:19:17.82,Main,,0,0,0,,You won't get away!Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.31,0:19:22.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Sodom...Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.89,0:19:24.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.04,0:19:39.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Chopper...Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.20,0:19:43.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Hm?! The Baby Transponder Snail is ringing?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.66,0:19:45.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Hello? Who is it?Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.40,0:19:47.70,Main,,0,0,0,,It's me.Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.70,0:19:48.77,Main,,0,0,0,,That's Granny Kokoro!Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.77,0:19:50.34,Main,,0,0,0,,What're you calling for?Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.72,0:19:56.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you guys are still alive. There's something I forgot to tell you.Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.38,0:20:00.52,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you guys are busy, so I'll make it quick. Listen carefully.Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.52,0:20:02.04,Main,,0,0,0,,On the map drawn by Paulie,Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.04,0:20:05.58,Main,,0,0,0,,there's no path from the courthouse to the Gates of Justice, right?Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.58,0:20:08.87,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right. I was just thinking about that.Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.87,0:20:12.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Look at the courthouse. There's a tower on each side, right?Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.67,0:20:13.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there is.Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.96,0:20:18.92,Main,,0,0,0,,There's a lever on the top floor of each tower.Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.92,0:20:21.22,Main,,0,0,0,,When you pull them, a drawbridge will come down....Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.22,0:20:24.24,Main,,0,0,0,,from the courthouse to the Gates of Justice.Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.24,0:20:27.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Granny, how come you know that stuff?Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.27,0:20:30.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I came here with Tom-san to fix the bridge a long time ago.Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.60,0:20:33.23,Main,,0,0,0,,That damn ungrateful, stupid Government!Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.23,0:20:35.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't take it out on me.Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.12,0:20:36.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Chimney wants to talk to you, too.Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.94,0:20:40.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Hello, pirate lady! Can you hear me?Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.50,0:20:42.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa! What is it, Chimney?Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.42,0:20:48.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen. I saw the rubber pirate guy on the rooftop of the courthouse.Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.81,0:20:51.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Really?! Luffy was there?Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.72,0:20:57.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I saw rocks collapsing there, too, so it looks like he's going on a rampage.Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.17,0:21:00.38,Main,,0,0,0,,On the rooftop? Got it. Thanks.Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.38,0:21:03.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Pirate girl, keep the Transponder Snail connected...Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.87,0:21:06.20,Main,,0,0,0,,so that I'll know what's going on over there.Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.20,0:21:07.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay...!Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.33,0:21:08.43,Main,,0,0,0,,So they said.Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.27,0:21:11.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Now we know where we have to go.Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.81,0:21:13.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.73,0:21:21.13,Main,,0,0,0,,All right, you guys go straight to the courthouse and meet up with Straw Hat-san.Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.13,0:21:22.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.29,0:21:29.63,Main,,0,0,0,,We're gonna split into two groups and bring the drawbridge down.Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.23,0:21:34.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Take us to the courthouse, Gomorrah!Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.75,0:21:44.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Gomorrah!Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.90,0:21:55.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Who are they?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.76,0:22:14.20,Note,,0,0,0,,Tattoo: GuiltyDialogue: 0,0:22:13.19,0:22:17.34,Main,,0,0,0,,It won't be that easy... you damn trash.Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.81,0:22:24.45,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! The second one is down, too!Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.29,0:22:28.83,Main,,0,0,0,,The pirates no longer have a way of getting around!Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.83,0:22:30.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Surround them and bring them down!Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.73,0:22:33.46,Main,,0,0,0,,To all the guards in Enies Lobby!Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.46,0:22:35.92,Main,,0,0,0,,At the center of Block D in the southeast area,Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.92,0:22:38.88,Main,,0,0,0,,we brought down the King Bull that the pirates were riding on!Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.88,0:22:43.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Call in all the soldiers and fully blockade Block D!Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.49,0:22:48.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I repeat! All guards, fully blockade Block D!Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.08,0:22:51.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Looks like the jury delivered the verdict.Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.87,0:22:54.56,Main,,0,0,0,,No one can beat them.Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.44,0:22:58.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Why won't you speak?Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.31,0:22:59.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.26,0:23:00.90,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll capture them right away!Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.90,0:23:00.94,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:00.94,0:23:00.98,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:00.98,0:23:01.02,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:01.02,0:23:01.06,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:01.06,0:23:01.10,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:01.10,0:23:01.15,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:01.15,0:23:01.19,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:01.19,0:23:01.23,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:01.23,0:23:01.27,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:01.27,0:23:01.31,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:01.31,0:23:01.35,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:01.35,0:23:01.40,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:01.40