urthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:03.98,0:23:04.02,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:04.02,0:23:04.07,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:04.07,0:23:04.11,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:04.11,0:23:04.15,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:04.15,0:23:04.19,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:04.19,0:23:04.23,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:04.23,0:23:04.27,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:04.27,0:23:04.32,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:04.32,0:23:04.36,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:04.36,0:23:04.40,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:04.40,0:23:04.44,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:04.44,0:23:04.48,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:04.48,0:23:04.52,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:04.52,0:23:04.57,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:04.57,0:23:04.61,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:04.61,0:23:04.65,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:04.65,0:23:04.69,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:04.69,0:23:04.73,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:04.73,0:23:04.77,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:04.77,0:23:04.82,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:04.82,0:23:04.86,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:04.86,0:23:04.90,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:04.90,0:23:04.94,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:04.94,0:23:04.98,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:04.98,0:23:05.02,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:05.02,0:23:05.07,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:05.07,0:23:05.11,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:05.11,0:23:05.15,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:05.15,0:23:05.19,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:05.19,0:23:05.23,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:05.23,0:23:05.27,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:05.27,0:23:05.32,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:05.32,0:23:05.36,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:05.36,0:23:05.86,Captions,,0,650,470,,CourthouseDialogue: 0,0:23:05.86,0:23:10.42,Main,,0,0,0,,The guards that we passed are  catching up. This isn't good.Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.42,0:23:12.99,Main,,0,0,0,,More and more are coming from the front and the sides.Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.00,0:23:15.41,Main,,0,0,0,,The trench mortars are aiming at us, too.Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.41,0:23:19.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Ahhh! This is terrible! There are thousands of them!Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.42,0:23:24.68,Main,,0,0,0,,If we get surrounded by them in a place like this, we'll be goners!Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.68,0:23:28.03,Captions,,0,0,4,,Tower of LawDialogue: 0,0:23:28.03,0:23:30.68,Main,,0,0,0,,You're a lucky person.Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.68,0:23:33.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Most people don't get a rescue squad, you know.Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.24,0:23:40.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not like I'm jealous that my underlings aren't here to rescue me!Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.99,0:23:52.33,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! An earthquake?Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.35,0:24:00.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-They're...Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.20,0:24:01.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Amazing!Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.81,0:24:08.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.22,0:24:17.45,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! Oimo and Kashi are back in action!Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.45,0:24:18.92,Main,,0,0,0,,This is bad....Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.90,0:24:23.54,Main,,0,0,0,,We don't have the energy to fight guys like them.Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.40,0:24:27.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this it for us?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.31,0:24:36.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and stomp on them! Take care of those three, Giants!Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.08,0:24:47.26,Main,,0,0,0,,How...Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.26,0:24:49.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Dare you....Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.14,0:24:54.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.64,0:24:56.66,Main,,0,0,0,,deceive us?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.37,0:25:06.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the heck?! Those two went over to the enemy's side!Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.48,0:25:09.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Before we rejoice over the safety of our bosses...Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.27,0:25:11.99,Main,,0,0,0,,before we grieve over our wasted years...Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.99,0:25:16.35,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll take out all our anger on these guys in a furious rampage!Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.35,0:25:19.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go together... king of snipers!Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.19,0:25:31.22,Main,,0,0,0,,No need for formalities! Raise the counterattack signal this time for sure!Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.22,0:25:34.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry to our comrades!Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.02,0:25:36.84,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Feeso, Galaxy 9000  Timing: Galaxy 9000, KaitouYahiko  Quality Assurance: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: CrunchyrollDialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HDialogue: 2,0:00:00.17,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 2,0:00:00.21,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:00:00.24,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,hDialogue: 2,0:00:00.28,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 2,0:00:00.31,0:00:01.57,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 2,0:00:00.35,0:00:01.57,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02